              "start": 13
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Supreme Court vacated the Court of Appeals\u2019 judgment and remanded the case for further proceedings consistent with its opinion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "337341fd16d462a379b89feff32c3840fed571f0a4e25e64e4e6a8154c383db4",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-337341fd16d4-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 13,
              "start": 13
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that the District Court had discretion to impose a \u00a7924(j) sentence concurrently with another sentence because the consecutive\u2011sentence mandate in \u00a7924(c)(1)(D)(ii) does not govern \u00a7924(j) sentences."
      }
    ],
