          "text": "According to Ms. Ross (Respondent), according to Ms. Ross (Respondent), according to Ms. Ross (Respondent), section\u202f924(j) sweeps in all of subsection\u202f(c)\u2019s provisions and does not pick and choose particular factual elements."
